            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Read here at magnification after two readers disagreed, one giving 19.9.10 and 867, the other 14.4.10 and 864. The number reads 367, which matches the catalogue, and that agreement is the reason to prefer this reading of the figures."
